-### 1533 — Vendor launch migration was lossy for tracked-run identity
-- ROOT CAUSE: `vendorplugin.SpawnRequest` omitted `agentic.RunContext`, and `PassthroughLaunch` therefore returned `LaunchRequest.Run == zero`; migrating the consumer from `agentic.BuildPlan` to `BuildLaunch` would make every system's `WithRunContext` remove run/task/board/context environment identity.
