-- NOTE: Provenance re-verified rather than assumed after the reseed — two full captures under different `t.TempDir` allocations produced byte-identical fixtures, so masking is doing real work. Source checkout `ed4878123061b39fdae67160f6b5632117b48a2f`, clean before and after, one `go test` inside it.
